  "details": "These Online status sorting option is confusing me and I suggest to re-phrase them, example:\n\nIn-world ---> In-Game\n\nActive ---> On-Website\n\nReason: In client, when a user clear his status text and save as \"green\"(the normal status), it will also appear as \"Active\" in client's user info page. So for this reason, users may feel the \"in-world\" and \"Active\" are saying the same thing, if they wish to sort their friends only avaliable on website.",
